    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>∀</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the imaginary part of <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> cannot be"
